10 PRINT "SAVING FOR SOMETHING SPECIAL"
20 INPUT "HOW MUCH MONEY DO YOU NEED"; GOAL
30 INPUT "HOW MUCH CAN YOU SAVE EACH WEEK"; WEEKLY
40 IF WEEKLY > 0 THEN 60
50 PRINT "YOU MUST SAVE MORE THAN ZERO."
55 GOTO 30
60 LET SAVED = 0
70 FOR WEEK = 1 TO 52
80 LET SAVED = SAVED + WEEKLY
90 IF SAVED >= GOAL THEN 130
100 NEXT WEEK
110 PRINT "AFTER ONE YEAR YOU HAVE SAVED"; SAVED
120 END
130 PRINT "YOU REACHED YOUR GOAL IN"; WEEK; "WEEKS!"
140 PRINT "YOU SAVED"; SAVED
150 END
